1
00:00:00,610 --> 00:00:01,340
What happens if

2
00:00:01,340 --> 00:00:01,980
you fall into a

3
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:02,970
black hole?

4
00:00:03,090 --> 00:00:03,640
It depends on

5
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:04,930
how big it is.

6
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:06,120
A small one,

7
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:06,880
ten times as

8
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,230
heavy as the Sun,

9
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:08,720
pulls much

10
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:09,320
harder on your

11
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:09,920
feet than on

12
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:10,730
your head.

13
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:11,020
You'd be

14
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:11,760
stretched into a

15
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:12,440
noodle before

16
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,300
you even reach

17
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:14,070
it.

18
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:14,820
Astronomers

19
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:15,780
really call this

20
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,150
spaghettification.

21
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:18,400
A giant one,

22
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,340
like the one at

23
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:19,980
the center of our

24
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:20,790
galaxy,

25
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:21,790
is gentler.

26
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:22,600
You'd cross its

27
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,410
edge,

28
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:23,720
the event

29
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:24,060
horizon,

30
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:24,840
and feel

31
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:25,590
nothing.

32
00:00:26,090 --> 00:00:26,420
But a friend

33
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:27,380
watching from far

34
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:28,200
away sees you

35
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:29,290
slow down,

36
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:29,960
turn red and fade,

37
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:31,740
as if frozen at

38
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:32,630
the edge.

39
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:33,640
For you,

40
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:34,850
time goes on.

41
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:35,570
Inside,

42
00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:36,640
every path leads

43
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:37,790
to the center,

44
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:38,100
and you have

45
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:38,700
only seconds

46
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:39,530
left.

47
00:00:40,090 --> 00:00:40,440
What happens

48
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:41,140
there?

49
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:42,210
Nobody knows.

50
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:43,100
Our laws of physics

51
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,290
break down.

52
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:45,320
So if you get

53
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:45,680
the choice,

54
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:46,380
pick a giant

55
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:47,150
one.

56
00:00:47,170 --> 00:00:47,900
Or better:

57
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:48,770
be the friend.

